# Runtime product image uploads (local filesystem storage)
# Runtime uploads are LIVE DATA and must never be committed.
# NOTE: these patterns are anchored to the repository root so the upload
# SOURCE routes under src/app/api/admin/uploads and src/app/uploads stay
# tracked — only runtime storage directories are ignored.
/.runtime-data/
/uploads/
/public/uploads/

